_pdbx_nmr_refine.details            
;Structure determination was performed iteratively with CYANA v2.1 using NOE-based constraints and PHI and PSI dihedral angle constraints from TALOS+. The 20 conformers out of 100 with the lowest target function were further refined by simulated annealing in explicit water bath using the program CNS with OPLSX force field.
